{{for|the item base|Ring (base type)}}
'''Rings''' are a [[item class|class of items]] that provide a variety of different bonuses when [[Equipment|equipped]]. They are categorised as [[jewellery]]. Up to two rings can be equipped simultaneously. [[The Unseen Hand]] passive from the [[Nameless Bloodline]] grants a third ring slot, which is considered to be neither on the left nor right slot.

Like most jewellery items, rings do not come with gem [[socket]]s. The one exception is {{il|Unset Ring}}, which gains one socket from its [[implicit modifier]].

